# Reqnroll telemetry marker (anonymous usage-telemetry GUID, written by Reqnroll's MSBuild
# tooling in the test project directory the first time it runs). Not sensitive, just noise.
# The real fix (opting scaffolded pp-test-ui/pp-test-ui-selenium projects out of Reqnroll
# telemetry by default) lives upstream in TALXIS/tools-devkit-templates; this entry is
# defense-in-depth here in case a template still lacks the opt-out or telemetry ever writes
# something regardless.
Reqnroll/

# NuGet
*.nupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Lab note: .lab-state.json is intentionally committed so progress survives crashes.
